      'about.desc': "I'm a student aiming for a Full-Stack developer profile. I'm passionate about technology in all its forms: besides software development, I dedicate a good part of my free time to exploring operating systems, especially Linux, and automating tasks with bash scripts. I love diving deep into system administration and hardware; understanding how things work from the ground up is what I enjoy the most.\nI am detail-oriented and proactive: I don't settle for the first working solution. I always strive to think iteratively and algorithmically until I find the best approach. I constantly train myself with courses and new technologies, because I feel that in this field you never stop learning.",
      'stack.title': 'Stack',
      'stack.cat.lenguajes': 'Languages',
      'stack.cat.frontend': 'Frontend',
      'stack.cat.backend': 'Backend & APIs',
      'stack.cat.db': 'Databases',
      'stack.cat.tools': 'Tools & Version Control',
      'stack.cat.systems': 'Systems',
      'proyectos.title': 'Projects',
      'proyectos.tikentry.title': 'TikEntry - QR Ticket System',
      'proyectos.tikentry.desc': 'Fullstack web application for event ticket management with QR code access control. It allows organizers to create, distribute, and validate tickets in real-time across multiple simultaneous access gates.',
